
.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "MyUtils" "MyUtils Library"
.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.B int mystrlen(const char *s);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrlen
function calculates the number of characters in the string
.BR s ,
not including the terminating null character.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters in the string.
.SH AUTHOR
Iman Amir
